{title: 450 - Beautiful Zion}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Early Advent}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[D]Beautiful Zion, [A]built [D/A]above,
[D]Beautiful [Bm]city [A/C#]that [A7/C#]I [D]love,
[D]Beautiful gates [F#m/C#]of [G/B]pearly white,
[G]Beautiful [D]tem [Bm]ple, [D/A]God [A7]its [D]light.

Verse 2:
[D]Beautiful trees forever [A7]there,
[D]Beautiful [Bm]fruit they [A/C#]always [D]bear,
[D]Beautiful rivers [F#m/C#]gliding [D/A]by,
[G]Beautiful [D]fountains never dry.

Verse 3:
[D]Beautiful crowns on [A]every [D]brow,
[D]Beautiful [Bm]palms the [A/C#]conquerors show,
[D]Beautiful robes [F#m/C#]the [G/B]ransomed wear,
[G]Beautiful [D]all [Bm]who [D/A]enter there.
